<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-RINCON WINS 17TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RINCON WINS 17TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>CERLER, Spain 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oliverio Rincon of Colombia won the 158-km 17th stage of the Tour of Spain from Sabinanigo to Cerler on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
